    - amqtt has no direct synchronous drop-in equivalent for mqtt.Client(client_id=...).connect(host, port) — connection setup requires an async 
context/session and a broker URI, not host/port args, requiring restructuring beyond simple call-site wrapping.
    - This constitutes a fundamentally different async/sync execution model that the call sites structurally depend on, which per the migration rules cannot be
